# Claude Code working directory. Ignored per-entry rather than wholesale:
# alongside settings.local.json it also collects settings.json and runtime
# scratch such as scheduled_tasks.lock, none of which describe this project.
# skills/ is the deliberate exception — those procedures (fleet delegation,
# Win32 verification, handoff format) must travel with every clone; their
# absence from the fleet clone stalled a delegation once. Un-ignore further
# entries deliberately rather than letting them follow a git add -A.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

